      "statement": "The public `manifold.eval` barrel exports `BeforeAfterEval`, `BeforeAfterResult`, `SliceGrid`, `ComparisonPageBuilder`, `JitComparison`, and `ControlNetComparison` from `src/manifold/eval/__init__.py`; only `manifold-eval` is registered in `[project.scripts]` (`pyproject.toml`).",
